@startuml
participant "OZO Platform\n(Team A)" as TeamA
participant "FHIR API" as FHIR
participant "OZO Platform\n(Team B)" as TeamB

== Thread Creation (Team A initiates) ==
TeamA -> FHIR : Create CommunicationRequest\n(status: 'active')\nrequester/sender = Practitioner A1\nextension[senderCareTeam] = CareTeam A\nrecipient = CareTeam B
FHIR -> FHIR : Create one Task per team\nTask(owner CareTeam B): 'requested'\nTask(owner CareTeam A): 'completed'\n(initiating team)
FHIR -> TeamB : Notify\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamB -> FHIR : Fetch CommunicationRequest
note over TeamB : Thread appears in\nTeam B's shared inbox

== Read Receipt by Team B ==
TeamB -> FHIR : Create AuditEvent\n(type: iso-21089-lifecycle 'access', action: 'R')\nagent.who = Practitioner B1\nagent.extension[careTeam] = CareTeam B
FHIR -> FHIR : Complete Task(owner CareTeam B)
note over FHIR : Read for the whole team,\nAuditEvent records who read

== Reply from Team B ==
TeamB -> FHIR : Create Communication\nsender = Practitioner B1\nextension[senderCareTeam] = CareTeam B\npartOf = CommunicationRequest\n(no recipient on Communication)
FHIR -> FHIR : Thread parties = recipient\n+ extension[senderCareTeam]\nacting team = CareTeam B
FHIR -> FHIR : Task(owner CareTeam A): 'requested'\nTask(owner CareTeam B): 'completed'\nfocus = new Communication
FHIR -> TeamA : Notify\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamA -> FHIR : Fetch Communication
note over TeamA : New message in\nTeam A's shared inbox

== Follow-up from Different Team A Member ==
TeamA -> FHIR : Create AuditEvent (read receipt)\nagent.who = Practitioner A2\nagent.extension[careTeam] = CareTeam A
FHIR -> FHIR : Complete Task(owner CareTeam A)
TeamA -> FHIR : Create Communication\nsender = Practitioner A2\n(different team member)\nextension[senderCareTeam] = CareTeam A\npartOf = CommunicationRequest
FHIR -> FHIR : acting team = CareTeam A
FHIR -> FHIR : Task(owner CareTeam B): 'requested'\nTask(owner CareTeam A): 'completed'\nfocus = new Communication
FHIR -> TeamB : Notify\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamB -> FHIR : Fetch Communication
note over TeamB : Two Tasks per thread,\nno inference of the team
@enduml
